# Custom rules written for this lab only. When adding or changing a rule, update docs/detection-catalog.md in the same commit.
# SID range: 9000000–9999999 (local rules)

# DET-000 pipeline canary — not an attack detection rule.
# Confirms the path sensor capture → EVE → Vector → ClickHouse → Grafana is alive.
# Trigger: curl http://<sensor external IP>/nsm-pipeline-canary
alert http any any -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"NSM PIPELINE CANARY request"; flow:established,to_server; http.uri; content:"/nsm-pipeline-canary"; startswith; classtype:misc-activity; sid:9000000; rev:1; metadata:nsm_id DET-000, created_at 2026_09_13;)
